#: src/languages/tailwindcss.md:44
msgid "Using Tailwind CSS Mode in CSS Files"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/tailwindcss.md:46
msgid ""
"Zed includes support for the Tailwind CSS language mode, which provides full "
"CSS IntelliSense support even when using Tailwind-specific at-rules like "
"`@apply`, `@layer`, and `@theme`. Configure language servers in Settings "
"(<kbd class=\"keybinding\">cmd-,\\|ctrl-,</kbd>) under Languages > CSS, or "
"add to your settings file:"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/tailwindcss.md:51
msgid "\"languages\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/tailwindcss.md:52
msgid "\"CSS\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/tailwindcss.md:53
msgid "\"language_servers\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/tailwindcss.md:54
msgid "\"tailwindcss-intellisense-css\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/tailwindcss.md:55
msgid "\"!vscode-css-language-server\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/tailwindcss.md:56
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/tailwindcss.md:63
msgid ""
"The `tailwindcss-intellisense-css` language server serves as an alternative "
"to the default CSS language server, maintaining all standard CSS "
"IntelliSense features while adding support for Tailwind-specific syntax."
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/tailwindcss.md:65
msgid "Prettier Plugin"
msgstr ""

#: src/languages/tailwindcss.md:67
msgid ""
